# L §8.2 before from:, E §9 item 3 (tally 2.1.7 R7, issue #146; #121): a movement before the scenario's from
# that reads the scenario's facts (pay, at a law date after from, reads fee) is listed under each result whose
# reads reach it, `before from: <instance> on <day> reads <item>`. 2.1.6's refcore refused ENGINE-INVARIANT
# (invariant 3). (T's G6 law_after.)
=== law_after.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "G6 review B1: a base move before from, read at a law date after it"

source card "card"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input fee: money PLN

input pay_day: date

input law_day: date

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  at law_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount fee

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fee = 100.00 PLN "the card"
  pay_day = 2026-03-01 "the card"
  law_day = 2026-08-01 "the card"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
=== law_after_s.tally
scenario more over hh
  tally 2
  from 2026-07-01

version more_fee
  cite card
  governs 2026-07-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace fee = 150.00 PLN "more"

ask b1: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in more
=== expect b1
b1: 150.00 PLN
  world: more
  before from: pay on 2026-03-01 reads fee
  held: fee = 150.00 PLN (more_fee), read for 2026-08-01
  cut 2026-03-01
